{"v":1,"id":"fc2338361154","synced":false,"offset":null,"source":"whisper","lines":[{"t":"The wind still whispers through the wreaths","s":30.0,"e":36.04},{"t":"Love remembers what the heart still needs","s":37.0,"e":42.52},{"t":"Beneath the weight of all that's gone","s":44.04,"e":49.72},{"t":"The spirit hums creation's song","s":51.0,"e":57.1},{"t":"Oh, beloved, hush your mind","s":57.1,"e":64.2},{"t":"The world is cruel, yet God is kind","s":64.86,"e":71.72},{"t":"He knows your scars, He's walked before","s":71.72,"e":78.74},{"t":"He breaks the chains, unlocks the door","s":78.74,"e":86.02},{"t":"Hear Him now, through the quiet rain","s":87.4,"e":93.16},{"t":"Every tear has not been in vain","s":94.92,"e":100.66},{"t":"Be still, beloved, lay down your fear","s":102.02,"e":108.06},{"t":"The Lord of hosts is ever near","s":108.06,"e":115.2},{"t":"The voice that calmed the raging sea","s":116.06,"e":122.44},{"t":"Holds your heart eternally","s":124.0,"e":129.36},{"t":"The stars bear witness","s":141.5,"e":144.42},{"t":"Strong and true","s":144.42,"e":147.82},{"t":"Of mercy shining down on you","s":148.6,"e":155.1},{"t":"Through shattered dreams","s":155.72,"e":158.78},{"t":"Through endless nights","s":159.7,"e":163.06},{"t":"His hands shall cool you into light","s":163.06,"e":169.78},{"t":"When all is lost and hope feels thin","s":170.7,"e":177.34},{"t":"That is the place His peace begins","s":178.92,"e":184.22},{"t":"Be still and love it","s":186.26,"e":188.32},{"t":"Lay down your fear","s":188.32,"e":192.02},{"t":"The Lord of hosts is ever near","s":193.0,"e":199.1},{"t":"His whisper soft as morning dew","s":200.56,"e":206.08},{"t":"Breathes eternal life in you","s":207.78,"e":212.98},{"t":"And when you hear the trumpet cry","s":216.16,"e":220.32},{"t":"And all creation lifts its sign","s":221.66,"e":228.58},{"t":"All this fire was meant to cleanse","s":230.24,"e":234.92},{"t":"Not break, but heal and make amends","s":234.92,"e":242.94},{"t":"He walks beside you","s":268.34,"e":271.92},{"t":"Unseen friend","s":271.92,"e":275.02},{"t":"His love unbroken","s":275.58,"e":278.98},{"t":"Without end","s":278.98,"e":282.82},{"t":"Where sorrow lingers","s":283.98,"e":286.26},{"t":"Where joy will bloom","s":286.78,"e":289.66},{"t":"The grave is empty","s":290.92,"e":293.48},{"t":"Be still, beloved","s":296.82,"e":300.96},{"t":"Be still","s":300.96,"e":308.22},{"t":"I know","s":309.42,"e":314.24},{"t":"© transcript Emily Beynon","s":326.16,"e":329.04},{"t":"Be still, be still, be still, be still","s":361.36,"e":366.92},{"t":"The winds still whisper","s":389.66,"e":393.9},{"t":"And know","s":396.6,"e":399.38},{"t":"Oh, oh, oh, oh","s":399.38,"e":406.48},{"t":"Oh, oh, oh, oh","s":406.48,"e":412.04}],"match":null}
